      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RED CARD (5) hit the ground running with a slick early sectional but had to settle for a minor placing when a 1.5 lengths second over 390m at this track, clocking 22.33. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Key chance in this line up. OSCAR MIKE (1) was well in the market last time but only managed fifth (22.57), beaten 10 lengths. Finished second the start before. The form out of his last race has been franked. Likely to be about the mark. LIL COCKATOO (2) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish second (22.68) at this track in a T3 RSTW over 390m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Can feature again. SCOTT QUIBBLE (4) placed last start and is in the mix again.",
